[routes]
POST /notes                   `{text, read_once: true}` → 201 {id, token}; the note answers one read
GET /notes/{id}               → 200 on the first read; 410 {error: "gone", reason: "read"} after it
POST /notes/{id}/archive      → 410 {error: "gone", reason: "read"} once the note is gone

